{
    "chapter_num": 16,
    "verses_count": 31,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Parable of the Unjust Steward"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He also said to His disciples: "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“There was a certain rich man who had a steward, and an accusation was brought to him that this man was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "squandering"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "wasting his goods."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "So he called him and said to him, ‘What is this I hear about you? Give an"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "account of your stewardship, for you can no longer be steward.’"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Then the steward said within himself, ‘What shall I do? For my master is taking the stewardship away from me. I cannot dig; I am ashamed to beg."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "I have resolved what to do, that when I am put out of the stewardship, they may receive me into their houses.’"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“So he called every one of his master’s debtors to him, and said to the first, ‘How much do you owe my master?’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And he said, ‘A hundred"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gr. batos, same as Heb. bath; 8 or 9 gallons each"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "measures of oil.’ So he said to him, ‘Take your bill, and sit down quickly and write fifty.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Then he said to another, ‘And how much do you owe?’ So he said, ‘A hundred"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gr. koros, same as Heb. kor; 10 or 12 bushels each"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "measures of wheat.’ And he said to him, ‘Take your bill, and write eighty.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "So the master commended the unjust steward because he had dealt shrewdly. For the sons of this world are more shrewd in their generation than"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "the sons of light."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“And I say to you,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "make friends for yourselves by unrighteous"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit., in Aram., wealth"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "mammon, that when"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU it fails"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "you fail, they may receive you into an everlasting home."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "He who is faithful in what is least is faithful also in much; and he who is unjust in what is least is unjust also in much."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Therefore if you have not been faithful in the unrighteous mammon, who will commit to your trust the true riches?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And if you have not been faithful in what is another man’s, who will give you what is your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "own?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“No servant can serve two masters; for either he will hate the one and love the other, or else he will be loyal to the one and despise the other. You cannot serve God and mammon.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Law, the Prophets, and the Kingdom"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the Pharisees, who were lovers of money, also heard all these things, and they "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. turned up their nose at"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "derided Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“You are those who"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "justify yourselves"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "before men, but"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "God knows your hearts. For"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "what is highly esteemed among men is an abomination in the sight of God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“The law and the prophets were until John. Since that time the kingdom of God has been preached, and everyone is pressing into it."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And it is easier for heaven and earth to pass away than for one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "The smallest stroke in a Heb. letter"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "tittle of the law to fail."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Whoever divorces his wife and marries another commits adultery; and whoever marries her who is divorced from her husband commits adultery."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Rich Man and Lazarus"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“There was a certain rich man who was clothed in purple and fine linen and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "lived in luxury"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "fared sumptuously every day."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "But there was a certain beggar named Lazarus, full of sores, who was laid at his gate,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "desiring to be fed with"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU what fell"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "the crumbs which fell from the rich man’s table. Moreover the dogs came and licked his sores."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "So it was that the beggar died, and was carried by the angels to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Abraham’s bosom. The rich man also died and was buried."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And being in torments in Hades, he lifted up his eyes and saw Abraham afar off, and Lazarus in his bosom."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Then he cried and said, ‘Father Abraham, have mercy on me, and send Lazarus that he may dip the tip of his finger in water and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "cool my tongue; for I"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "am tormented in this flame.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "But Abraham said, ‘Son,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "remember that in your lifetime you received your good things, and likewise Lazarus evil things; but now he is comforted and you are tormented."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And besides all this, between us and you there is a great gulf fixed, so that those who want to pass from here to you cannot, nor can those from there pass to us.’"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Then he said, ‘I beg you therefore, father, that you would send him to my father’s house,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "for I have five brothers, that he may testify to them, lest they also come to this place of torment.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Abraham said to him,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘They have Moses and the prophets; let them hear them.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And he said, ‘No, father Abraham; but if one goes to them from the dead, they will repent.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "But he said to him,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘If they do not hear Moses and the prophets,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "neither will they be persuaded though one rise from the dead.’ ”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}